16 Whistleblowing and reporting concerns > 16.3 How to raise a concern

Concerns can be raised with any of the following:

- the employee's line manager or Head of Department;

- the Head of Risk and Compliance (compliance@northstar.example);

- speakup@northstar.example;

- the independent **Speak Up line** , operated by an independent third-party provider and available 24/7 by web form and telephone via the intranet, which accepts anonymous reports.

